  "summary": "<p>Today, Katie Zacharia delivered a commanding inaugural press briefing as the 37th White House Press Secretary. The briefing, which generated wall-to-wall coverage, served as a strong introduction to her tenure and highlighted the Trump Administration’s record of delivering historic successes for the American people.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/10/katie-zacharia-delivers-powerful-inaugural-briefing-as-37th-white-house-press-secretary/\">Katie Zacharia Delivers Powerful Inaugural Briefing as the 37th White House Press Secretary</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov\">The White House</a>.</p>",
